\newlabel{fig:subsets}{{4}{4}{A--C: selections on the same 10,000-cell \texttt {gated\_alive} t-SNE reference (perplexity 30), evaluated only during each donor's 4--16 test appearances. Grey means never selected. D: selected full-test-donor marker profiles with equal weights for all 20 contributing donors, on a common z-scale. Empty selections remain in frequency denominators but have no marker profile}{figure.caption.4}{}}
